Schema for **configure_app_for_customer_signup**:
```json
{
  "name": "configure_app_for_customer_signup",
  "description": "**Required step for any customer-facing app** \u2014 after `create_app` + `create_profile`, call this to enable self-service registration. Does all 5 platform-side wires in one call:\n  1. PATCH appUsageType \u2192 B2C (or whatever you pass)\n  2. Set REGISTRATION_TYPE app property (default: REGISTRATION_TYPE_NO_VERIFICATION)\n  3. Add `userProfile` reg entry \u2192 auto-assigns the given profile to every new registrant\n  4. Add `fileAccess` reg entries (STATIC + SECURED, Authorities.Logged_IN)\n  5. Add `appAccess` reg entry (self-reference) so the user can reach the app\n\nWithout this, the app's `create_app` defaults leave it as appUsageType=S (Standalone), which BLOCKS /api/security/clients/register with 'Not allowed for Standalone Applications'. The only users who can log in are pre-provisioned sysadmins, which is fine for marketing sites but fundamentally broken for any product with customers.\n\nWhen to skip: only for internal tools / marketing sites / appbuilder-class apps. If the user describes anything customer-facing (POS, ticketing, e-commerce, social, etc.), call this.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "app_code": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Target appCode"
      },
      "app_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "security_app id (numeric) \u2014 get from list_security_apps"
      },
      "profile_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Profile to auto-assign on registration"
      },
      "app_usage_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "B2C (individuals) | B2B (business clients) | B2X (both) | X",
        "default": "B2C"
      },
      "registration_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "One of REGISTRATION_TYPE_NO_VERIFICATION | _VERIFICATION | _CODE_IMMEDIATE_LOGIN_IMMEDIATE",
        "default": "REGISTRATION_TYPE_NO_VERIFICATION"
      },
      "level": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "CLIENT | CUSTOMER | CONSUMER \u2014 defaults from usage_type (B2C\u2192CONSUMER, others\u2192CUSTOMER)"
      },
      "client_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Owning client_id (default 1 = SYSTEM)",
        "default": "1"
      },
      "client_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "IND for individual consumers, BUS for business clients",
        "default": "IND"
      },
      "business_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Business type code, default COMMON",
        "default": "COMMON"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "app_code",
      "app_id",
      "profile_id"
    ]
  }
}
```

